INDEX tests/cases/
F 00-foundation.sh    Shared ground: cld-lib.sh, repo and path resolution, the temp-tree contract, the loader and cld.conf
F 10-index-audit.sh   Directory-index checker: every finding with a control, failing sweeps, --gone
F 20-symbol-audit.sh  Symbol-index checker: every finding with a control, languages, I entries, --gone, the lookups and skills
F 30-gate.sh          Real commits through the installed hooks: routing, staged content, fail-closed checks, the installer
F 40-combined.sh      A host running both checkers: an older cld.conf, and one policy for a bad index.cld header
